  "description": "The Shift R7 27.5\" is our new foray into All-Mountain riding with a modern geometry and 12-speed components at an affordable price tag. Featuring our Shift R 140mm travel frame with our new 4-bar linkage design, up-to-date geometry and proprietary X6 aluminum tubing, the Shift R7 model is equipped with the Sram SX 12-speed group featuring the DUB Boost crankset, derailleur, shifter and wide ratio 11-50T cassette for easy climbing and crisp shifting. With 150mm of front suspension provided by a Rockshox Recon RL fork and a specifically tuned X-Fusion air rear shock, the Shift R7 will satisfy a large variety of riding styles with its steeper seat tube angle for more efficient pedaling, its slacker head tube angle (at 66 degrees) and longer reach for an improved attack position.",
